{'symbol': 'ADI', 'date': '2021-12-03 16:00:00', 'title': 'ANALOG DEVICES TO PARTICIPATE IN THE UBS GLOBAL TMT CONFERENCE', 'text': "WILMINGTON, MASS.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--ANALOG DEVICES, INC. (NASDAQ:ADI) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT THE COMPANY'S CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER, PRASHANTH MAHENDRA-RAJAH, WILL SPEAK AT THE UBS GLOBAL TMT VIRTUAL CONFERENCE TO BE HELD ON WEDNESDAY, DECEMBER 8, 2021, AT 10:00 A.M. EASTERN TIME. THE WEBCAST FOR THE CONFERENCE MAY BE ACCESSED LIVE VIA THE INVESTOR RELATIONS SECTION OF ANALOG DEVICES' WEBSITE AT INVESTOR.ANALOG.COM. AN ARCHIVED REPLAY WILL ALSO BE AVAILABLE FOLLOWING THE WEBCAST. ABOUT ANALOG DEVI"}